What this batch adds:

- Standard Foundation / Intermediate / Higher challenge controls.
- Standard Questions / Correct / Accuracy / XP / Streak tracking.
- Hint, Show working, Try again and New question/scenario controls.
- Real ProgressContext XP awarding via useSimulator.
- Existing hands-on CPU, memory and storage explorers retained and expanded.
- Mojibake/encoding characters in these replacement files cleaned.

After extracting into the project root run:
npm run build

Then test CPU, Memory, Storage Capacity and Storage Comparison lesson simulator steps at all three difficulty levels.
